    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>Xiamy and Yuez find a lost baby. A lost newborn baby.<br><br>They start on a journey to find who this baby belongs to, while fending off the dark monsters chasing after it. As they travel using a sort of phone booth as their vehicle of choice, they meet a bunch of unique people, make friends, and they give and receive help here and there.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/0e39a34c158b60d7a879b39d64a2205b.poster.avif?t=1754392951\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/0e39a34c158b60d7a879b39d64a2205b.webm?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/0e39a34c158b60d7a879b39d64a2205b.mp4?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2>PIGGY ONE SUPER SPARK mixes the satisfying, fast-paced action of a 2D scroller with the feeling of adventure of a road movie\u2014all with poppy, colorful art to boot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/51c74d94498dcec1ae627da9c71a3538.poster.avif?t=1754392951\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/51c74d94498dcec1ae627da9c71a3538.webm?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/51c74d94498dcec1ae627da9c71a3538.mp4?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Xiamy has got her blazing speed, Yuez has got her incredible strength, and the baby... Oh, the baby has some powers as well.<br><br>With their abilities and the powers of magnets and electricity, there's no enemy or puzzle that they can't take on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.poster.avif?t=1754392951\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.webm?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.mp4?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tighten your seatbelts. This rollercoaster of an adventure is going to hit you with all its heart and all its thrills.",
