their abilities and the powers of magnets and electricity, there's no enemy or puzzle that they can't take on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.poster.avif?t=1754392951\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.webm?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780230/extras/797703e409e91e50294dddee66a8f16c.mp4?t=1754392951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tighten your seatbelts. This rollercoaster of an adventure is going to hit you with all its heart and all its thrills.",
